            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kendin dene: <code>tasks</code> dizisindeki öğeleri say.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dusting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;laundry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"howMany\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>tasks</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>length</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Görev sayısını <code>howMany</code> içinde sakla, ardından bu sayıyı yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"tasks\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;dusting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;laundry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"howMany\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"tasks\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"length\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"howMany\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"size\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks[0]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;howMany&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>tasks</code>, ardından <code>length</co